{
  "video_id": "vOhuf18b-g8",
  "whisper_model": "base",
  "transcribe_seconds": 29.3,
  "audio_seconds": 430.1,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.72,
      "text": "I thought with confidence that this would be the year that I finally switch over to a foldable phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1921631971995036,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.187574103474617,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7653429602888087
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 6.72,
      "end": 11.52,
      "text": "I've been testing these things for like seven or eight years, but I've never been drawn to one the way that I've been drawn to the fold seven.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1921631971995036,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.187574103474617,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7653429602888087
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 11.52,
      "end": 18.32,
      "text": "Because this is the first product that's been like, it looks and feels and has the weight and thickness of a regular phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1921631971995036,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.187574103474617,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7653429602888087
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 18.32,
      "end": 25.240000000000002,
      "text": "It's just that when you want it to, you can open it up and it's like a bigger screen experience in a tablet-like device.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1921631971995036,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.187574103474617,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7653429602888087
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 25.799999999999997,
      "end": 33.96,
      "text": "And I've been using this for two weeks. I thought for sure this would be the one, but I just, I don't like it nearly as much as I thought it would.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12614543510205817,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015517577528953552,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 33.96,
      "end": 42.36,
      "text": "So in order to explain where I'm coming from, we have to go back a little bit and think about the origins of why we even are so enamored with foldable phones in the first place.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12614543510205817,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015517577528953552,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 42.36,
      "end": 45.08,
      "text": "I think it just boils down to versatility, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12614543510205817,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015517577528953552,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 45.08,
      "end": 51.959999999999994,
      "text": "We want a device that can be a phone when we want it to be and then a tablet for that big screen experience when we want it to be.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12614543510205817,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015517577528953552,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 52.2,
      "end": 58.28,
      "text": "And Versatile Tech, it's always so cool on paper, like a two-in-one tablet, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13333536883977454,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006677570287138224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.860377358490566
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 58.28,
      "end": 63.56,
      "text": "It's like the idea that you could have a tablet and a laptop in one product, but versatility also comes with the cost.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13333536883977454,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006677570287138224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.860377358490566
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 63.56,
      "end": 71.96000000000001,
      "text": "The cost of, I'm not talking about price, I'm talking about like you have engineering compromises that you have to make in order to have a multi-function device.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13333536883977454,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006677570287138224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.860377358490566
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 71.96000000000001,
      "end": 78.76,
      "text": "So in the two-in-one tablet, you have a tablet experience that's not perfect and you have a laptop experience that's not perfect,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13333536883977454,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006677570287138224,
      "compression_ratio": 1.860377358490566
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 78.76,
      "end": 81.56,
      "text": "but you have a versatile two-in-one product.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.15469371763050047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002720432821661234,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8314606741573034
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 81.56,
      "end": 88.28,
      "text": "And the same thing that's been in the case with foldable phones, you have a phone experience that's typically not perfect because it's like a little bit thicker or whatever.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.15469371763050047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002720432821661234,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8314606741573034
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 88.28,
      "end": 94.12,
      "text": "And you also have a tablet experience that's also imperfect because there's things you have to do to be able to make it foldable.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.15469371763050047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002720432821661234,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8314606741573034
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 94.12,
      "end": 106.76,
      "text": "Now, on the Fold 7 this year, I think Samsung made the phone experience really good, like as close as possible to a regular like slab phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.15469371763050047,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002720432821661234,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8314606741573034
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 106.76,
      "end": 111.32000000000001,
      "text": "Because now it's like the same weight and same dimensions as a regular slab phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1169035850314919,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0019059646874666214,
      "compression_ratio": 1.692
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 111.32000000000001,
      "end": 115.24000000000001,
      "text": "But in doing so, they had to make it really thin to do that, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1169035850314919,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0019059646874666214,
      "compression_ratio": 1.692
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 115.24000000000001,
      "end": 120.84,
      "text": "In doing so, the tablet experience is noticeably worse than it was in previous generations.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1169035850314919,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0019059646874666214,
      "compression_ratio": 1.692
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 120.84,
      "end": 128.04000000000002,
      "text": "So the first thing, right when I opened it from the box two weeks ago, I thought when I first unboxed it, I'm like, huh,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1169035850314919,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0019059646874666214,
      "compression_ratio": 1.692
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 128.04000000000002,
      "end": 131.4,
      "text": "it's a little bit harder to open than previous generations.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1169035850314919,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0019059646874666214,
      "compression_ratio": 1.692
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 131.48000000000002,
      "end": 132.84,
      "text": "But I thought, you know, it's a new product.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 132.84,
      "end": 137.32,
      "text": "Maybe my Fold 6 has seen so much use that it got used to it, but it's not the case.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 137.32,
      "end": 143.4,
      "text": "I think two weeks later, it's just that the Fold 6, first of all, there's more material to grip onto when you do open it.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 143.4,
      "end": 146.76,
      "text": "But the hinge is just like, it's just built differently.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 146.76,
      "end": 148.6,
      "text": "It's like a nice, easy open.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 148.6,
      "end": 152.92000000000002,
      "text": "The Fold 7, for sure, this is a tougher product to hold to open.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 152.92000000000002,
      "end": 154.6,
      "text": "You got to, you just got to work it.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 154.6,
      "end": 159.64000000000001,
      "text": "I'm surprised I didn't add some kind of like ledge or some kind of notch that you can work to just crank it open.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11897397924352575,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014457983896136284,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7635782747603834
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 160.11999999999998,
      "end": 162.6,
      "text": "But there's less material to open when it's so thin, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 162.6,
      "end": 167.39999999999998,
      "text": "Also, when you do open it, because it's so thin this year, we've lost the S Pen functionality, which I think",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 167.39999999999998,
      "end": 168.92,
      "text": "disappointed a lot of people.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 168.92,
      "end": 171.07999999999998,
      "text": "We don't have the under display camera anymore.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 171.07999999999998,
      "end": 173.64,
      "text": "We now have like the punch hole that's always there.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 173.64,
      "end": 176.76,
      "text": "The speakers are noticeably worse this generation than the previous.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 176.76,
      "end": 181.0,
      "text": "It's not like awful speakers, but they were quite good on the Fold 6 before.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 181.0,
      "end": 182.92,
      "text": "And we also have a massive camera bump.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 182.92,
      "end": 184.6,
      "text": "This protrudes out a lot.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 184.6,
      "end": 186.6,
      "text": "And the image quality is better this year.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1308912549700056,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001176953432150185,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7046153846153846
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 186.68,
      "end": 192.76,
      "text": "But to me, that improvement in image quality is so not worth the bulk that this camera system has added.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 192.76,
      "end": 194.51999999999998,
      "text": "You definitely need a case of some sort.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 194.51999999999998,
      "end": 196.12,
      "text": "The wobble on this thing is pretty severe.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 196.12,
      "end": 197.64,
      "text": "And I don't know.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 197.64,
      "end": 202.04,
      "text": "It just sticks out so much that I have a tough time calling this phone really thin,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 202.04,
      "end": 204.12,
      "text": "because the hardware bump is no joke.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 204.12,
      "end": 207.79999999999998,
      "text": "But despite all the quirks we talked about, fundamentally,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 207.79999999999998,
      "end": 210.6,
      "text": "Samsung brought out something that was very impressive.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 210.6,
      "end": 212.12,
      "text": "The hardware is amazing.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10065751917221967,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.024206150323152542,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5972696245733788
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 212.12,
      "end": 214.76,
      "text": "You're able to have a phone that is actually super thin like this,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 214.76,
      "end": 217.24,
      "text": "but opens up into this big screen experience.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 217.24,
      "end": 218.28,
      "text": "It's impressive.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 218.28,
      "end": 221.48000000000002,
      "text": "But we got to talk about this whole big screen experience,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 221.48000000000002,
      "end": 224.20000000000002,
      "text": "because this is what everyone's drawn to, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 224.20000000000002,
      "end": 226.68,
      "text": "The idea of that big screen experience.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 226.68,
      "end": 233.4,
      "text": "So right off the bat, this screen is awesome for viewing documents and PDFs and reading e-books.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 233.4,
      "end": 237.16,
      "text": "These are things that I never do, but it is fantastic screen for that.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 237.88,
      "end": 240.92000000000002,
      "text": "Now, the other thing that Samsung pushes is the idea of multitasking.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14416820352727716,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020096562802791595,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7457627118644068
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 240.92,
      "end": 244.51999999999998,
      "text": "You get split screen and floating windows for multi-app workflows.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 244.51999999999998,
      "end": 246.11999999999998,
      "text": "The new software is awesome for that.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 246.11999999999998,
      "end": 248.11999999999998,
      "text": "But again, these are things that I don't really do.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 248.11999999999998,
      "end": 249.23999999999998,
      "text": "I thought I would.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 249.23999999999998,
      "end": 251.95999999999998,
      "text": "I thought I would at least at some point make use of it,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 251.95999999999998,
      "end": 254.44,
      "text": "but it's just not in my workflow.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 254.44,
      "end": 257.96,
      "text": "So I'm sure there's tons of people that do make use of multi-app workflows,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 257.96,
      "end": 260.03999999999996,
      "text": "like very productive, awesome people.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 260.03999999999996,
      "end": 261.24,
      "text": "But I'm just, I'm not that.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 261.24,
      "end": 264.68,
      "text": "I'm a degenerate that watches videos that looks at shorts.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.17798225453357822,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0016977692721411586,
      "compression_ratio": 1.8041237113402062
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 264.68,
      "end": 266.59999999999997,
